B.aqU=new A.c(B.aJi,["A name to identify this business deal. You can leave it blank.","The seller\u2019s requested price for the business, before deal adjustments.","Total sales generated by the business in a typical year, before expenses.","Reported annual earnings before interest, tax, depreciation and amortization.","One-time or owner-specific expenses you can verify in the records and add back to earnings.","Owner pay already included as an expense in reported EBITDA. Do not add it again if EBITDA already excludes it.","Annual pay and benefits needed to hire someone to replace the owner\u2019s work.","Typical yearly spending to maintain equipment and other operating assets.","The lower comparable-sale multiple applied to maintainable EBITDA.","The upper comparable-sale multiple applied to maintainable EBITDA.","Percent of the asking price you plan to pay in cash at closing.","Annual interest rate assumed for the acquisition loan.","Number of years over which the acquisition loan is paid down.","The seller\u2019s requested price for the assets in this deal.","Current market value of equipment and vehicles included in the sale.","Realistic sale value of usable inventory included in the deal.","Customer amounts owed that you expect to collect and acquire.","Supportable value of transferable assets such as licenses, contracts or intellectual property.","Cash balances that transfer to you at closing.","Debts and other obligations you agree to take over.","Cost to repair or replace assets whose upkeep has been deferred.","Legal, appraisal, transfer and other costs of completing the purchase.","Percent of noncash asset value you expect to recover in a quick sale.","A name to identify this property deal. You can leave it blank.","The seller\u2019s requested purchase price for the property.","Annual rent the property could earn if all rentable space paid as expected.","Annual property income outside base rent, such as parking or storage.","Percent of potential income lost to empty space and unpaid rent.","Annual property operating costs, excluding debt payments and income tax.","Annual allowance for replacing major building components over time.","Market capitalization rate used to convert stabilized net operating income into value.","Percent of the property asking price you plan to pay in cash.","Annual interest rate assumed for the property loan.","Number of years over which the property loan is paid down.","Number of years you expect to own the property before selling.","Expected yearly percentage change in net operating income.","Capitalization rate assumed when estimating the property\u2019s sale value."],t.w)
